## Session Flow

When starting a new conversation:
1. Run `/preflight` to load context (STATUS.md, LESSONS_LEARNED.md, DECISIONS.md)
2. Use role-specific workflow for the task (/evm-dev, /frontend-dev, etc.)
3. Run `/deploy-sync` after any deployment
4. Run `/coordinator` at end of session to update status docs

## Decision Matrix

- Starting new chat → /preflight
- Writing Solidity → /evm-dev
- Writing React/TypeScript → /frontend-dev
- Mixed contract + frontend → /fullstack-dev
- Deploying contracts → /deploy → /deploy-sync
- Code review → /auditor
- End of session → /coordinator
- Agent made mistake → Add to .agent/LESSONS_LEARNED.md

## Key Files

- `.agent/KNOWLEDGE.md` - Protocol facts, formulas, architecture
- `.agent/LESSONS_LEARNED.md` - Past mistakes to avoid
- `STATUS.md` - Current project state
- `DECISIONS.md` - Architecture decisions

## Critical Rules

- Always read KNOWLEDGE.md before modifying contracts
- Always read LESSONS_LEARNED.md before deployments
- Bump deployments.json version after config changes
- WAD × WAD multiplication requires /1e18
